#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:5 523ca66d6d2d47a4984c668953a8e583
msgid "_`Usage`"
msgstr "用法"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:7 277de585066c44f99920a26b70004372
msgid ""
"The conanfile.py is the Conan recipe of food_volume_measure. It declares "
"the requirements, prepares the build files, and defines the package that "
"conan create exports."
msgstr ""
"conanfile.py 是 food_volume_measure 的 Conan 配方。它声明依赖、准备构建文件，并定义 conan "
"create 导出的包。"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:10 727ada7d5db14c3297d9c7bca37e8fd8
msgid "_`Main Features`"
msgstr "主要特性"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:12 721fc80f78bf4d8c90ccb75de1363af1
msgid "Package metadata and requirement loading"
msgstr "加载包元数据与依赖项"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:13 35d9eb5a12e249de9ecdc9a8e5eccc54
msgid "Dependency selection for regular, bare-metal and test builds"
msgstr "针对常规、裸机与测试构建筛选依赖"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:14 875552b325a344d79478e4b491b19975
msgid "CMake toolchain generation with dependency wiring"
msgstr "生成 CMake toolchain 并接入依赖"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:15 491226de67cc42a29975b21e10c20145
msgid "Optional C++ module generation"
msgstr "可选的 C++ 模块生成"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:16 0bdbeb511ea14001a73adf3511574a8e
msgid "C header compatibility for C consumers"
msgstr "面向 C 使用者的 C 头文件兼容处理"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:17 314dfe984c0d43b086ee686f06688717
msgid "Binary ABI validation before packaging"
msgstr "打包前的二进制 ABI 校验"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:20 4fb3360493cf4bf39ebc9ef7c93d3848
msgid "_`Core Functionality`"
msgstr "核心功能"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:22 7c0af3b3029d434f9140c38866a80c78
msgid ""
"The PackageRecipe class initializes the package from metadata.json and "
"takes the requirement list from conandata.yml. gtest is dropped from the "
"runtime requirements because only the tests need it, and pybind11 is "
"required only while enable_python_bindings is on. During a bare-metal "
"cross build only the packages named in baremetal_white_list are kept."
msgstr ""
"PackageRecipe 类从 metadata.json 初始化包，并从 conandata.yml 取得依赖列表。gtest "
"会从运行时依赖中移除，因为只有测试需要它；pybind11 仅在 enable_python_bindings 打开时才需要。裸机交叉构建时只保留"
" baremetal_white_list 中列出的包。"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:24 bf61dadb9f3a4244b82474ce80d9fc82
msgid ""
"generate() writes the CMake toolchain and the dependency files. The four "
"dependency buckets of metadata.json - common, c, cpp and infra - are "
"merged and serialized into the C_DEPS and CPP_DEPS variables as "
"Pkg@Targets pairs, which is exactly the form CMakeLists.txt expects. A "
"bare-metal build keeps only the whitelisted entries and switches "
"CMAKE_TRY_COMPILE_TARGET_TYPE to STATIC_LIBRARY. The module preprocessing"
" step turns the exported .hpp and .cpp files into C++ module units from "
"their export and attach markers, and C headers are rewritten with extern "
"\"C\" guards so that C consumers can include them."
msgstr ""
"generate() 写出 CMake toolchain 与依赖文件。metadata.json 的四个依赖分桶——common、c、cpp 与"
" infra——被合并并序列化为 C_DEPS 与 CPP_DEPS 变量中的 Pkg@Targets 对，这正是 CMakeLists.txt "
"所期望的形式。裸机构建只保留白名单条目，并把 CMAKE_TRY_COMPILE_TARGET_TYPE 切换为 "
"STATIC_LIBRARY。模块预处理步骤根据 export 与 attach 标记把导出的 .hpp 与 .cpp 文件转换为 C++ "
"模块单元，同时把 C 头文件重写为带 extern \"C\" 保护的形式，以便 C 使用者可以包含它们。"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:26 c26ad2eb6d874fe5923116761ab98e24
msgid ""
"build() runs the CMake flow, and _validate_built_archives inspects the "
"produced archives with ar and readelf to detect an ABI mismatch. Because "
"the float ABI and FPU settings arrive as compiler flags rather than as "
"Conan settings, package_id also hashes tools.build:cflags and "
"tools.build:cxxflags; without that, two MCUs sharing an architecture "
"string but not an ABI would reuse the same cached binary and fail at link"
" time."
msgstr ""
"build() 运行 CMake 流程，_validate_built_archives 则用 ar 与 readelf 检查产出的归档文件以发现"
" ABI 不匹配。由于 float ABI 与 FPU 设置是以编译选项而非 Conan settings 的形式传入，package_id "
"也会对 tools.build:cflags 与 tools.build:cxxflags 取哈希；否则两个架构字符串相同但 ABI 不同的 "
"MCU 会复用同一份缓存二进制，并在链接期失败。"

#: ../../source/components/conan.rst:28 fa04520d00da41aaa6fdc19530f31777
msgid ""
"package() and package_info() then define what is exported and how "
"consumers link against it."
msgstr "package() 与 package_info() 随后定义导出内容以及使用者如何链接。"

